        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "お土産に買ってきた瓶入りの海胆を、炊きたてのご飯に乗せる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "晩酌のつまみに、少し贅沢な海胆をつまむ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "日本酒の肴に、この特製の海胆は最高だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
